# system_server probes the HIDL variant of some vendor interfaces (e.g.
# vendor.oplus.hardware.displaypanelfeature) before falling back to the working
# AIDL service. Those HIDL interfaces are not registered and not labelled, so
# the hwservicemanager lookup lands on default_android_hwservice and is denied.
# Harmless -- the AIDL service serves the feature -- but newly noisy now that
# hwservicemanager answers lookups. Suppress the cosmetic get-then-fallback probe.
dontaudit system_server default_android_hwservice:hwservice_manager find;

